@startuml 异常处理决策流
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam ActivityFontColor #1F2933
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 异常处理决策流:统一走 catch → finally 双层 abort

start

:传输过程中出现异常;

fork
  :建链超时
  (5s 无首帧);
  :throw;
fork again
  :握手期失败检测命中
  (detectHandshakeFailure);
  :throw "handshake failed: <原因>";
fork again
  :空闲超时
  (reason="idle");
  :controller.abort()
  → signal abort
  → raceAbort reject
  / onAbort 调 session.abort();
fork again
  :总时长到点
  (overall 触发);
  if (是否仍在推进?) then (是)
    :reason="overall-proceeding";
  else (否)
    :reason="overall-stalled";
  endif
  :controller.abort() → signal abort;
fork again
  :对端拒绝
  (ZSKIP);
  :throw;
fork again
  :ZFIN 握手失败;
  :closeSessionWithTimeout 超时
  → cleanEnded=false;
end fork

:catch: session.abort()
**(协议层 abort)**;

note right
  <b>双层 abort 缺一不可</b>
  - 协议层: 让本地 zmodem.js
    状态机的悬挂 Promise 进入 aborted 态
  - 传输层: 让设备端 rz/sz 进程退出
end note

:finally: if (!cleanEnded)
abortDeviceSession(shell)
**(传输层 abort: CAN×5+BS×5 + drainPort)**;

:finally: recoverShell(shell)
排空缓冲;

stop

@enduml
